        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thiec kɛ kui̱ mi̱eth mi ca ka̱m kuth jiɛn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ kɛ kui̱ mi̱thni tin ca ka̱m kuth jiɛn, ŋa̱cnɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö, “Kɔn diaal ta̱nɛ kɛ ŋäc ŋɔaani.” Kä ŋäc ŋɔaani kɔ̱pɛ raan kɛ liak, kä nhök piithɛ raan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi caar raan ɛ ɛn ɣöö ŋäcɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱r, ŋotdɛ /cɛ jɛ ŋäc, ce̱tkɛ ŋäc in derɛ ŋäc ni jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö mi nhɔk raan Kuoth, jɛn ŋäc Kuoth ɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kui̱ mi̱eth kä min ca ka̱m kuth baaŋ, ŋa̱cnɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö, “thilɛ kuoth baaŋ rɛy ɣɔaa mi te wanɔ” kɛnɛ ɣöö “thilɛ Kuoth ɛ ni kɛl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö cäŋ tëëkɛ ti cɔalkɛ i̱ kuth nhial kiɛ piny, ɛpuc tëëkɛ ti cɔalkɛ “kuth” kɛnɛ “kua̱r” ti ŋuan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ŋotdɛ kɛ kui̱dan Kuoth ɛ kɛl, in la Gua̱a̱r in te nhial. Kä ɛ cääk kä ti diaal, kä ɛ jɛn ɛ ni̱n tëk kɔn kɛ jɛ. Kä te ni Kuäär kɛl thi̱n, min la Yecu Kritho, min ca ŋɔaani diaal cak kɛ jɛ, kä tëk kɔn kɛ jɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /cikɛ nɛy diaal ŋa̱ckɛ thuɔ̱k ɛmɛ ɔ. Tha̱a̱ŋ nath cikɛ ŋa̱c ni kuth baaŋ, kɛ ɣöö mi cikɛ mi̱eth mi ce̱tkɛ ɛn ɔ cam, ŋotdɛ carkɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö ɛ mi̱eth mi ca thöp kuoth baaŋ. Kɛn kɔ̱c ca̱r lo̱cnikiɛn, la kɛn ɛ a caar i̱ ca rɔ̱ ya̱r kɛ mi̱ethdiɛn kɛ mi̱eth ɛmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi̱eth /cɛ kɔn bi nööŋ gekä Kuɔth. /Ci jiääkdan di̱t mi /canɛ mi̱th, kä /ci gɔɔydan di̱t mi mi̱ethnɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö niɛkɛ rɔ̱ kɛ ɣöö /ci ciaŋ lɔrädun ɛmɛ nɛy tin kɔ̱c ŋäthädiɛn bi pɛn dui̱rä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi ca ji̱ nɛn ɛ nɛy kɔ̱kiɛn, ji̱n ram min ŋäc ŋɔak, a mi̱thi rɛy luaak kuɔth baaŋ. /Ci nɛy ɛ tɔ̱ min kɔ̱c ca̱r lo̱cnikiɛn, rɔ̱ bi com ɛn ɣöö bikɛ mi̱eth in ca ka̱m kuth baaŋ cam? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ŋäc ŋɔaanidu ba nɛy tin kɔ̱c ŋa̱thdiɛn tin ci Kritho li̱w kɛ kui̱dɛ däk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi wi̱i̱ duer wä lät kä dämuɔɔri rɛy Kritho, kä bia ca̱riɛn ya̱r min ŋot kɛ kɔ̱a̱c, dui̱r yɛn ni Kritho duer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ, mi ɛ mi̱eth ɛn ni̱n jak dämaar kä pɛn dui̱rä, ɣän /cä ri̱ŋ bi met cam, kɛ ɣöö /cä dämaar bilɛ jakä tɛth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
